  lines:
  - text: Born from nineteenth-century Chinese merchant settlement and perfected
      through generations,
    characterSprite: {fileID: -511706578061346315, guid: ae71825725b21a3459805439433622ee, type: 3}
  - text: during the Batangas coffee boom, this dense noodle bowl represents a proud
